,"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256}},"oneOf":[{"required":["id"]},{"required":["name"]}],"additionalProperties":false},"minItems":1,"maxItems":3,"description":"1..3 explicit candidates in request order; one capture with target. Requires closed_solid_relation and surface_proximity; aabb optional."},"requested_facts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["aabb","center_delta","axis_gap","surface_clearance","solid_relation","nearest_witness","pair_relation","surface_proximity","closed_solid_relation"]},"minItems":1,"uniqueItems":true,"description":"task: closed_solid_relation is zero-tolerance separated/touching/penetrating (positive-volume overlap, including containment) for represented connected closed triangle shells; invalid/ambiguous is unknown. surface_proximity independently gives nonnegative triangle-surface distance, original world witness points and positive-distance A-to-B direction; zero-distance direction is inapplicable. Boundary/nonmanifold counts do not certify solids. Penetrating/contained distances are not separated gaps. pair_relation's escape of A is not surface distance, nearest direction or minimum depth."},"operation":{"type":"string","enum":["diagnose","patch","reference","restore_preview","reference_patch"],"description":"Registered target reads. mesh_structure: diagnose text or patch images. mesh_surface (local opt-in): diagnose/reference/restore_preview require include_image=false; reference_patch uses a returned opaque patch_ref and optional native images. References are locally trusted; previews do not execute; the original task budget applies."},"request_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128},"near_m":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":0.001},"threshold_m":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":0.01},"reference_ref":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{32}$"},"indices":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","minim